Third-party code
----------------

src/asas_cv_profile/skills.py holds a skill-list splitter from Resume-Matcher
(github.com/srbhr/Resume-Matcher), Copyright Saurabh Rai and Resume-Matcher
contributors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The change made
is stated in that file.

src/asas_cv_profile/arabic.py holds the Arabic diacritic set and three letter
normalisations of CAMeL Tools (github.com/CAMeL-Lab/camel_tools), Copyright
New York University Abu Dhabi, licensed under the MIT License. They are written
there as character maps; the tatweel is also dropped, which CAMeL Tools leaves.
